# {{.Name}}

A JSON API on [gesso](https://github.com/Elagoht/gesso), on {{.DialectName}}.

```sh
gesso add auth        # sign-in, a table of users
gesso add module <name> -field <field>:<type>   # gesso help add module
gesso gen             # after changing a model in models/models.go
gesso dev             # run it, restarted as files change
go test ./...
```

Settings come from the environment or `.env` (`.env.development` under `gesso dev`):

```sh
DATABASE_URL={{.DefaultDSN}}
ADDR=:8080
```
